<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>รายงานข้อมูลตู้เก็บของพนักงาน</title>
    <style>
        /* Sarabun font ถูกโหลดใน Layout แล้ว */
        
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Sarabun', 'TH Sarabun New', sans-serif;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background: #f8f9fa;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        
        /* Header Section */
        .report-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .report-header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><defs><pattern id="grain" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="100" height="100"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="1" fill="white" opacity="0.1"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100" height="100" fill="url(%23grain)"/></svg>');
            animation: grain 20s linear infinite;
        }
        
        @@keyframes grain {
            0%, 100% { transform: translate(0, 0); }
            10% { transform: translate(-5%, -5%); }
            20% { transform: translate(-10%, 5%); }
            30% { transform: translate(5%, -10%); }
            40% { transform: translate(-5%, 15%); }
            50% { transform: translate(-10%, 5%); }
            60% { transform: translate(15%, 0%); }
            70% { transform: translate(0%, 15%); }
            80% { transform: translate(-15%, 10%); }
            90% { transform: translate(10%, 5%); }
        }
        
        .report-header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        
        .report-header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
        }
        
        .report-header .date {
            font-size: 1rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 25px;
            display: inline-block;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        
        /* Stats Section */
        .stats-section {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .stats-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .stats-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .stats-card::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--card-color), var(--card-color-light));
        }
        
        .stats-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
        
        .stats-number {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--card-color);
        }
        
        .stats-label {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #666;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        
        .stats-icon {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            opacity: 0.7;
            color: var(--card-color);
        }
        
        /* Card Colors */
        .stats-total { --card-color: #6c757d; --card-color-light: #adb5bd; }
        .stats-available { --card-color: #28a745; --card-color-light: #6cbf6c; }
        .stats-occupied { --card-color: #007bff; --card-color-light: #66b3ff; }
        .stats-damaged { --card-color: #dc3545; --card-color-light: #e57373; }
        .stats-resigned { --card-color: #fd7e14; --card-color-light: #ffab70; }
        .stats-without { --card-color: #6f42c1; --card-color-light: #9c7bd1; }
        
        /* Table Section */
        .table-section {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 15px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        
        .table-header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }
        
        .table-header h2 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .table-container {
            overflow-x: auto;
            max-height: 600px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        
        th {
            background: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 1rem 0.75rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #495057;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #dee2e6;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 10;
        }
        
        td {
            padding: 0.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }
        
        tr:hover {
            background: #f8f9fa;
        }
        
        tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: #fdfdfd;
        }
        
        /* Badge Styles */
        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.25rem;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-radius: 20px;
            color: white;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        
        .badge-success { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745, #34ce57);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(40,167,69,0.3);
        }
        .badge-primary { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #007bff, #0ea5e9);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,123,255,0.3);
        }
        .badge-danger { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dc3545, #ef4444);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(220,53,69,0.3);
        }
        .badge-warning { 
        .badge-success { background-color: #28a745; }
        .badge-primary { background-color: #007bff; }
        .badge-danger { background-color: #dc3545; }
        .badge-warning { background-color: #ffc107; color: #212529; }
        .badge-secondary { background-color: #6c757d; }
        
        .resigned-owner {
            color: #dc3545;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .resigned-badge {
            background-color: #dc3545;
            color: white;
            padding: 1px 4px;
            border-radius: 2px;
            font-size: 8px;
            margin-left: 3px;
        }
        
        .footer {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 10px;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 5px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        
        @@media print {
            body { 
                print-color-adjust: exact; 
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
            }
            .stats-section { 
                break-inside: avoid; 
                page-break-inside: avoid;
            }
            .table-section { 
                break-inside: avoid; 
                page-break-inside: avoid;
            }
            table { 
                break-inside: auto;
            }
            tr { 
                break-inside: avoid; 
                page-break-inside: avoid;
            }
        }
        
        .page-break {
            page-break-before: always;
        }
        
        .no-break {
            page-break-inside: avoid;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>รายงานข้อมูลตู้เก็บของพนักงาน</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Employee Cabinet Management Report</div>
            <div class="date">สร้างเมื่อ: @DateTime.Now.ToString("dd/MM/yyyy HH:mm:ss")</div>
        </div>

        <!-- สถิติภาพรวม -->
        <div class="stats-section no-break">
            <div class="stats-grid">
                <div class="stats-card stats-total">
                    <div class="stats-number">@ViewBag.TotalCabinets</div>
                    <div class="stats-label">ตู้ทั้งหมด</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stats-card stats-available">
                    <div class="stats-number">@ViewBag.AvailableCabinets</div>
                    <div class="stats-label">ตู้ว่าง</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stats-card stats-occupied">
                    <div class="stats-number">@ViewBag.OccupiedCabinets</div>
                    <div class="stats-label">มีผู้ใช้งาน</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stats-card stats-damaged">
                    <div class="stats-number">@ViewBag.DamagedCabinets</div>
                    <div class="stats-label">ชำรุด</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stats-card stats-resigned">
                    <div class="stats-number">@ViewBag.ResignedOwnedCabinets</div>
                    <div class="stats-label">เจ้าของลาออก</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stats-card stats-without">
                    <div class="stats-number">@ViewBag.EmployeesWithoutCabinet</div>
                    <div class="stats-label">พนักงานไม่มีตู้</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- ตารางข้อมูล -->
        <div class="table-section">
            <div class="table-title">รายละเอียดตู้เก็บของ (@Model?.Count รายการ)</div>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th style="width: 40px;">#</th>
                        <th style="width: 60px;">เลขที่ตู้</th>
                        <th style="width: 200px;">ผู้ครอบครอง</th>
                        <th style="width: 80px;">สถานะ</th>
                        <th style="width: 100px;">อัพเดทล่าสุด</th>
                        <th style="width: 80px;">อัพเดทโดย</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                 <tbody>
                        {{TABLE_ROWS}}
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Enhanced Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem;">
                <div>
                    <strong>🏢 ระบบจัดการตู้เก็บของพนักงาน</strong><br>
                    <small>รายงานนี้สร้างอัตโนมัติจากระบบ</small>
                </div>
                <div style="text-align: right;">
                    <strong>📅 วันที่พิมพ์:</strong> {{REPORT_DATE}}<br>
                    <small>🔄 อัพเดทล่าสุด: {{REPORT_DATE}}</small>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>